Movie fallback session latch from Buku313/Skate3-Mobile:
  5ae21ad3797fd4af7a6abd4c8b313932bb8efa61 (1.5 s heartbeat and latch)
  d0472167a8c02015f446d0789eb6fe9e39e21bde (optional bounded timeout)

Port only YieldForMovie and its cvars onto skate3recomp f6e0ae8. The base
function and cvar match Buku's pre-5ae21ad versions byte-for-byte. No menu
compilation, Android UI, or native GPU changes are included.

Preserve upstream timeout defaults: 6000 ms on Android, 0 (disabled) on
Linux and other platforms. A positive timeout prevents re-entry until a
heartbeat gap of at least 1.5 s ends the decoder session. Quad freshness
still gates entry, but cannot cancel an already latched fallback.

